<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: Adare says 76.3 pct take-up in open offer.</title>
<headline>Adare says 76.3 pct take-up in open offer.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Adare Printing Group Plc said on Friday said that 76.3 percent of its open offer had been take up by the closing date on July 24.</p>
<p>Adare announced on July 2 that it would raise around 17.9 million Irish pounds net of expenses through a placing and open offer.</p>
<p>The funds will be used to acquire the business and net assets of Kalamazoo Security Print from Kalamzoo Computer Group.</p>
<p>-- Dublin Newsroom +353 1 676 9779</p>
</text>
